+// Experimental API.
+// Puts the annotation saved as |id| back into |page|'s /Annots at raw position
+// |index| (clamped; -1 = at the end) — e.g. undo of FPDFPage_RemoveAnnot. An
+// annotation that was an indirect object comes back as the SAME object (its
+// dictionary restored to the state), unless the page already lists it; one
+// that was a direct dictionary comes back as a direct copy. Returns its
